{"parse": {"title": "JMP-10", "pageid": 6197, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/JMP-09\" title=\"JMP-09\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">JMP-10</span><a href=\"/wiki/JMP-11\" title=\"JMP-11\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">JMP</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">10</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.AF.B1.E7.AC.86.E5.A2.99.E4.B9.8B.E5.A4.96\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"篱笆墙之外\">篱笆墙之外</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 篱笆墙之外</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Outside the Fence</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>羔<span class=\"color-value\"></span>羊<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>知<span class=\"color-value\"></span>栅<span class=\"color-value\"></span>篱<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>作<span class=\"color-value\"></span>用<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1310109</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>呼……呼……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-tianwentai.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"tianwentai\"><img alt=\"tianwentai\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/Cg-tianwentai.png/600px-Cg-tianwentai.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/Cg-tianwentai.png/900px-Cg-tianwentai.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/Cg-tianwentai.png/1200px-Cg-tianwentai.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从幼时，到少年，再到青年。也只有在不符合逻辑的幻境中，人才能有机会直面这样多的、来自过去的自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——并将他们一一击败。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-307010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-307010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-307010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>……20岁的我真够凶的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伽菈波那揉着自己布满淤青的面颊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-307011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-307011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-307011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>嘶……好真实的痛感。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"613301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"613301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-613301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-613301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>你比我想的迅速，伽菈波那。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-at_tianwentaidenvren1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"at_tianwentaidenvren1\"><img alt=\"at_tianwentaidenvren1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-at_tianwentaidenvren1.png/600px-Cg-at_tianwentaidenvren1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-at_tianwentaidenvren1.png/900px-Cg-at_tianwentaidenvren1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-at_tianwentaidenvren1.png/1200px-Cg-at_tianwentaidenvren1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>天文台顶端的风声凛冽。熟悉到不能再熟悉、甚至梦中都会见到的面孔，再一次地出现在了眼前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>我知道你会来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-307011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-307011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-307011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>库玛尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-307011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-307011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-307011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>我终于……见到你了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-510201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-510201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-510201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>我也很想念你，我的孩子……希望在我不在的日子里，你一切都好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>希望你还满意我的安排。这个地方的环境我一直很喜欢——而且颇具纪念意义，很适合寒暄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-307011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-307011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-307011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>……我倒是希望你过得难受点，老师。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-at_tianwentaidenvren2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"at_tianwentaidenvren2\"><img alt=\"at_tianwentaidenvren2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/Cg-at_tianwentaidenvren2.png/600px-Cg-at_tianwentaidenvren2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/Cg-at_tianwentaidenvren2.png/900px-Cg-at_tianwentaidenvren2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/Cg-at_tianwentaidenvren2.png/1200px-Cg-at_tianwentaidenvren2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"560101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-560101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-560101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"560101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-560101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-560101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-560101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-560101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>哎呀，你和我说话真是越来越不客气了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伽菈波那抬头，打量着周围的环境。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-at_tianwentaidenvren1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"at_tianwentaidenvren1\"><img alt=\"at_tianwentaidenvren1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-at_tianwentaidenvren1.png/600px-Cg-at_tianwentaidenvren1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-at_tianwentaidenvren1.png/900px-Cg-at_tianwentaidenvren1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-at_tianwentaidenvren1.png/1200px-Cg-at_tianwentaidenvren1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"560101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-560101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-560101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"560101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-560101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-560101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-560101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-560101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>别看啦，孩子。再怎么说我的研究也比你早了那么几年，在幻境中完美掩盖好现实中的踪迹，是最基本的技巧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>天空阴沉着，像是肮脏玻璃器皿的表面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-307011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-307011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-307011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>可你竟然不肯在幻境里给自己一片星空。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对方沉默了片刻，轻轻摇了摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"560101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-560101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-560101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"560101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-560101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-560101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-560101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-560101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>……随时都可以见到的东西，没有必要。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-tianwentai.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"tianwentai\"><img alt=\"tianwentai\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/Cg-tianwentai.png/600px-Cg-tianwentai.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/Cg-tianwentai.png/900px-Cg-tianwentai.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/Cg-tianwentai.png/1200px-Cg-tianwentai.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>你让我过来，有什么目的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>我一向体恤你的努力，伽菈波那，就像当年我体恤我那个陌生的弟弟一样……哦，我想那封信成功寄到了，对吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>不过你还是很聪明的……你没将毗湿奴带过来。不会有人给你提醒了吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>算了，它本来就对我没什么用处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>……我不明白。你为什么把他牵扯进来？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>库玛尔身后，一个老式望远镜指向天空。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>唔，或许……正如你们所说，是仇恨所致的报复心理吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>我最开始的路，就被他们堵得死死的……尽管那孩子并不是始作俑者，但我的怒火总该找个人承担。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>来吧，你还想知道什么——我现在都可以告诉你。你好奇的，你困惑的，你那小脑袋瓜儿永远琢磨不出来的事儿，我现在都可以告诉你了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她温柔地笑着，话语却是令人熟悉的刻薄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>你就不怕我找到你吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伽菈波那试探性地靠近一步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>找到我？哈哈哈——哦！你还是像纸一样纯真，我的伽菈波那。脑筋不够灵活的小家伙——不可能的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>——这是你第一次质疑我的能力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>不，我怎么会质疑你的能力——你是唯一能赶上我脚步的孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>你只是……缺少了一点时间，以及缺乏了一点——良好的心态。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>我早就试图纠正过这些，一些即兴演讲，你记得吗？很好的锻炼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>……你……什么意思？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>你或许太相信我会依靠重塑了。比起重塑，我更信任自己的手段——当然也更信任你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>……更何况我也看不上那些家伙。但好在我什么都不像，又最习惯于伪装——就像我当初在班纳尔大学当教授的时候一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>库玛尔注意到伽菈波那一直盯着那个老式望远镜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>你怎么老看着这个？拿给你好了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女人轻巧一抛，被她摘下的寻星镜稳稳当当地落在了伽菈波那的手中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>周围仍是不变的景色。看不出任何端倪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>怎么？你以为它像那些石像一样，是击破幻境的核心处？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>虽然有点晚了，但我现在纠正你一点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她就像她说的一样，十分贴心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>你没有追上“我”，也没有做出最优抉择……你只是追着那个名为“获胜”的饵一直走到了现在，帮我达成了我想要达成的一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>——从你进来的那一刻起，我的目的就已经达到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>帮你……什么……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>你也知道，想要让幻境影响现实是很难的，毕竟，它就如同现实世界的倒影……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>我费了好大力气，浪费了一尊神像——才让里面的东西，伸出一点点影子来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>你是说，石窟里的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>而我需要的，是一个由外向内的力，彻底帮我打破这层难以单向冲破的薄膜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>毕竟镜子所映之物的能力有限，但如果镜子之外的现实有人来击碎它……那一切就容易得多了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>——这样幻境中的流星坠落之时……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>在我们的现实世界，也会有一颗同样美丽的星星落下！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>而这个击碎镜子的外力，真巧！正是现在你所做的这件事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>不，怎么会……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>所以我观测到的波动，甚至是那个基金会小女孩感受到的天体能量……那些只是幌子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>哦不，我得承认，那个小姑娘的到来属于意外事件……不过——你理解得非常正确！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>要怪就怪你自己的——冠冕堂皇。你的救人之心终究输给了与我竞争之心——人命在你心里……并不如在我面前证明你自己重要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>我想像得到你有多么努力地在说服自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>但你知道吗？其实你在想：“哦！库玛尔的神秘术连抬起个土块儿都困难，又哪里有能力做那些精巧的局呢？一定是依靠了重塑！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>别对自己这么没自信，你仍旧是我最好的学生——差那么一丁点智慧就能和我同台竞技的好同事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>这次你也没输给我的智慧——而是输给了一点我对你的了解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>……以及捕猎者的经验罢了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>我在此之前，从未……从未将重塑与你……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无意义的辩白被堵在喉咙里，在天文塔顶端的微风中，伽菈波那觉得自己的呼吸震耳欲聋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>所以，所以如果我这次没有来见你——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>那我就棘手了。你们将享受一个快乐的烛星节，而我只能在你们不知道的阴暗角落里，哭丧着脸认输。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>你，你为什么——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>哦，时间差不多了。这么重要的问题，下次记得早问，孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>不用感谢我的贴心，也别自作多情，解释这么多并不是为了你——我只是想要彻底的胜利。而你的绝望，正包含在这份胜利之内。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>——你也知道，我的个人趣味向来烂得离谱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>回去享受你们的烛星节吧——好消息是你们也能和我一样，能亲眼见见那颗漂亮的星星长什么样子了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>&lt;sprite=1&gt;<br />&lt;再见啦。&gt;</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "JMP-10"}}